LabKit cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/shared/labkit/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
LabKit provides RecordedDiagnosticReplay.
LabKit owns AppendLabRecord.
AppendLabRecord realizes RecordedDiagnosticReplay.
AppendLabRecord specifies "Assign local record sequence; retain bounded per-family history and report gaps independently of source-event sequence.".
LabKit owns PersistLabLedger.
PersistLabLedger realizes RecordedDiagnosticReplay.
PersistLabLedger specifies "Optional append-only versioned NDJSON ledger with source-session-qualified cursors.".
LabKit owns ManageLabCheckpoint.
ManageLabCheckpoint realizes RecordedDiagnosticReplay.
ManageLabCheckpoint specifies "Create/list/resolve checkpoints by stable identity, name and local record sequence.".
LabKit owns TransferLabArtifact.
TransferLabArtifact realizes RecordedDiagnosticReplay.
TransferLabArtifact specifies "Bounded chunked import/export with request correlation, offset, size and integrity checks.".
LabKit owns ReplayConfiguredRange.
ReplayConfiguredRange realizes RecordedDiagnosticReplay.
ReplayConfiguredRange specifies "Select explicit layer and server-configured isolated target; replay sequence/time/checkpoint range without arbitrary live endpoints.".
LabKit owns FormatLabConsole.
FormatLabConsole realizes RecordedDiagnosticReplay.
FormatLabConsole specifies "Provide domain-neutral command/RPC formatting helpers and deterministic in-memory clock/store seams.".
